      "id": "claim_b9281fe792484f85bc28b2b91118337c",
      "statement": "RuntimeManager is the mechanical V8 arm that owns handles and filesystem paths but never lifecycle policy; StartRuntime, Publish, and StopRuntime decide when a cell handle moves from starting to externally dispatchable to closed.",
